My method is to take the pet to either a dead end corridor, or at
least one that ends with a closed door.

+d@

I then drop the item I want tested and step away. A potion in this
example here.

+d!@

The pet has only one square to move to, the square with the potion.
If I see the "reluctantly" message, I know that the item is cursed.
If I don't then I know it's non-cursed. Easy.

